Suggested Teaching and Learning Activities
To facilitate students’ attainment of the objectives of this Section, teachers are advised to engage
students in the teaching and learning activities listed below.
1. Encourage the use of:
(a) calculators;
(b) games and quizzes;
(c) appropriate software (for example, create an excel document to calculate utility bills
and net salary);
(d) examples of consumer arithmetic drawn from current affairs;
(e) online videos;
